This behavior is verified in the test suite "Body methods with caching" in `src/request.test.ts`. The tests confirm that after calling one body-reading method (e.g., `req.text()`), subsequent calls to other methods like `req.json()` and `req.arrayBuffer()` work correctly by using the cached body.

